<title>USA: U.S. Q2 EMPLOYMENT COSTS ROSE 0.8 PCT.</title>
<headline>U.S. Q2 EMPLOYMENT COSTS ROSE 0.8 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
